<title>UK: Park Food says MBO talks ended.</title>
<headline>Park Food says MBO talks ended.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Park Food Plc said talks about a possible offer for the company by a group led by one of its directors, Stuart Marks, have been ended without agreement.</p>
</text>
